WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,640
Don't worry about seventeen bottles

2
00:00:01,920 --> 00:00:02,840
If you can’t sell it, just play it.

3
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:04,280
Our store has no rent

4
00:00:04,440 --> 00:00:08,770
I have plenty of time to waste time with them.

5
00:00:08,930 --> 00:00:13,680
Let's go play for a while, Brother Li.

6
00:00:13,680 --> 00:00:14,720
You finally answered the phone

7
00:00:14,840 --> 00:00:18,800
We agreed to deliver 100 bottles of coffee every day. Why hasn’t today’s coffee been delivered? Boss Yang, it’s not me who won’t deliver it.

8
00:00:19,160 --> 00:00:20,440
There's something wrong with the manufacturer

9
00:00:20,600 --> 00:00:21,560
There is not enough production now

10
00:00:21,720 --> 00:00:22,920
I don’t even have enough to sell in my own store

11
00:00:22,920 --> 00:00:23,840
I really can't faint

12
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:26,280
Is it a matter of price? I pay ten yuan at home.

13
00:00:26,400 --> 00:00:27,400
How about a bottle of thirty?

14
00:00:27,520 --> 00:00:30,560
It’s really not a matter of money. If the manufacturer doesn’t ship the goods, there’s nothing I can do about it.

15
00:00:32,840 --> 00:00:33,920
It's all your fault

16
00:00:34,480 --> 00:00:35,640
I was making good money originally

17
00:00:36,080 --> 00:00:37,560
I have to ask about other people’s supply channels.

18
00:00:38,040 --> 00:00:39,320
Didn’t you agree at that time?

19
00:00:39,720 --> 00:00:40,840
He sold us twenty

20
00:00:40,960 --> 00:00:42,040
I'm sure I'll make a lot of money
